    <string name="tagline">Total Transport Solutions</string>

    <!-- About -->
    <string name="about_mintaxis">MIN Taxis (Private) Limited is a family-owned business established in 2004 under the name Lisbury Enterprises (Private) Limited. We are Zimbabwe\'s leading total transport solutions provider with over 130 vehicles including taxis, buses, coaches, and rental cars, all equipped with UHF Radios, operating 24/7 throughout the year.</string>
    <string name="our_mission">We passionately believe in providing the highest quality and best value transport solutions. From individual taxi rides to corporate contracts, from airport transfers to bus hires for special events, MIN Taxis is your trusted partner for all transportation needs.</string>

